    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304736</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あっ！　忘れ物！
アイテム袋忘れた！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah! I forgot something!
I left our item bag!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304832</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もう、&lt;Dio&gt;ったら……
あっ……わたしも……
日記帳忘れた……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Jeez, &lt;Dio&gt;... Oh,
wait... I forgot something,
too... My diary...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304900</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんだよ、
人のこと言えねーだろ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So you can't 
talk, can you?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304968</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>やれやれ……
……ぼくも見てくるね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, well... ...I'll
help you look.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305028</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うん、
行ってらっしゃい</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Okay, see
you soon.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305112</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ダオス……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Dhaos...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305112</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>まさか、
また双子ちゃんを狙って……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You can't be...after
the twins again...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305184</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>彼らは自身の手で、
決着をつけるだろう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>They will be concluding that story
by their own hands, will they not?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305236</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……だったら……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Then...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305304</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おまえに
言い忘れたことがあった</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There is something
I forgot to tell you.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305348</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なに……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305416</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私はダオスという男の
亡想にすぎぬ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I am nothing but the last
thoughts of the man called
Dhaos, left behind as he died.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305476</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うん……残存思念だね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah... His lingering feelings...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305720</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だが、我が肉体は、
大樹カーラーンに救われ、
『大いなる実り』となった</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>However, my flesh and blood was
saved by the Great Tree Kharlan,
and became a Great Seed.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305720</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そして故郷
デリス・カーラーンへの
帰路についた</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And so, I returned to my
homeland, Derris-Kharlan.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305720</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>これは、誰も……私と
大樹カーラーン以外が
知ることのない事実……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This is a truth known to
none beyond myself and
the Great Tree Kharlan</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305720</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>伝えたかったのは、
それだけだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That is all I
wanted to tell you.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305776</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……それだけ、ね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...That's all, huh...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>306016</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>最後にひとつ、聞かせて</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There's one last thing I want to ask.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>306016</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>『大いなる実り』は……
ダオスは、故郷に戻れたの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The Great Seed... That is, you,
returned to your homeland?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>306016</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>デリス・カーラーンは
どうなったの……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Then how is Derris-
Kharlan doing now?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>306076</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>デリス・カーラーンは……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Derris-Kharlan is...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>306132</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>待たせてごめんなさい</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Sorry for making you wait.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>306196</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いいのいいの。
さ、行こうよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's totally fine.
Well, let's go.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>306240</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ああ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>306308</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Dio&gt;くん、
&lt;Mel&gt;ちゃん……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Dio&gt;, &lt;Mel&gt;...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>306408</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>………………</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>306408</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……ううん、
やっぱりなんでもないよ、
さ、行こっか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Nevermind. It's
nothing after all.
Well, time to go.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>306460</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……そ、っか……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Really...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>306524</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Rody&gt;、
どうしたんだ……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What's up with &lt;Rody&gt;...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>306580</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……わかんない、でも</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I don't know, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>306668</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……わたしたちがいない間に
なにかあったのかな……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Did something happen
while we were away...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>306740</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>オレら、
聞かねーほうがいいことかも</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Maybe it's better
if we don't ask.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>306796</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……かな……
かもね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Yeah...
Probably.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>306844</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どういうこと？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What do you mean?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>35</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>306896</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そういうことだって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Just one of those things.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>306964</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あ、&lt;Rody&gt;、
置いてかないで！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wait, &lt;Rody&gt;! Don't
leave us behind!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
